(7702426, 1264500, 56502, '<td valign="top">Good catch!</td>', 'Good catch!', '2021-10-02 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702453, 1264487, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but for me this is all about the silhouette rather than any backlighting.</td>', 'Nice image, but for me this is all about the silhouette rather than any backlighting.', '2021-10-03 22:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702455, 1264488, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very appealing photo.  I like the soft colors and the creative use of a blown out sky.  The highlight, as per the challenge, and pun intended, is the translucence of some of the birds'' wings.  In some respects they are become light itself, a transcendence of the material.  I feel taken to a new realm.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A very appealing photo.  I like the soft colors and the creative use of a blown out sky.  The highlight, as per the challenge, and pun intended, is the translucence of some of the birds'' wings.  In some respects they are become light itself, a transcendence of the material.  I feel taken to a new realm.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-03 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702456, 1264471, 173844, '<td valign="top">No need to rhapsodize about a crown fitted with a jewel, as a flower and bee are more than enough.  I like the direct statement it presents, the strength of beauty.  Both the sun shot petals and the sumptuous bee are exemplary.  A nice balance is achieved about the center.  The background beautifully enhances the overall image.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'No need to rhapsodize about a crown fitted with a jewel, as a flower and bee are more than enough.  I like the direct statement it presents, the strength of beauty.  Both the sun shot petals and the sumptuous bee are exemplary.  A nice balance is achieved about the center.  The background beautifully enhances the overall image.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-03 22:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702457, 1264427, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on the challenge.  And it''s said you can''t transmute base into gold...</td>', 'Lovely take on the challenge.  And it''s said you can''t transmute base into gold...', '2021-10-03 22:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702458, 1264485, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine study of these roof tilers as work.  The effective white framing enhances the overall diagonal subject.  It''s simple amidst a certain amount of complexity.  I especially admire how it''s the dust thrown up by the tile cutter that conveys the backlighting.  Another fun detail is how the hat worn by the man on the left echoes the pattern of the tiling.  Strong documentary style.<br/>Another personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Fine study of these roof tilers as work.  The effective white framing enhances the overall diagonal subject.  It''s simple amidst a certain amount of complexity.  I especially admire how it''s the dust thrown up by the tile cutter that conveys the backlighting.  Another fun detail is how the hat worn by the man on the left echoes the pattern of the tiling.  Strong documentary style.Another personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-03 22:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702459, 1264494, 173844, '<td valign="top">A warm, life-affirming image, with tons of effulgent sunshine.  I feel happy to see this.</td>', 'A warm, life-affirming image, with tons of effulgent sunshine.  I feel happy to see this.', '2021-10-03 22:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702460, 1264504, 173844, '<td valign="top">The quirky elegance of a young child.  The light spilling over him from behind displays a delicate, subtle touch.  The blown out background works well.  Sweet curls, sweet boy.</td>', 'The quirky elegance of a young child.  The light spilling over him from behind displays a delicate, subtle touch.  The blown out background works well.  Sweet curls, sweet boy.', '2021-10-03 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
